ative Party has I hope that  the whip will be restored to me and that  the Conservative Party will decide to  remain a broad Church where people of  very different opinions can work  together and can happily coexist within  the same party that's what we've always  been and that's what we need to be in  the future if we are going to be a  successful political party ok mr. hammer  thank you very much very good to see you

